    "description": "<p>You take a bundle of flash firecrackers, and use your chakra to light the wicks of each one before throwing them in an arc in front of you. Creatures standing in front of you in a 15-foot-wide space must make a Wisdom Save, giving you advantage on your next attack against them and disadvantage on their next attack on a failed save before the end of your next turn.</p>",
